3. Credits and sources of ideas (no code taken)
===============================================

  - Notification icon fix: the idea comes from howard20181's Notification Icon Fix
    (io.github.howard20181.notificationiconfix). Idea only: no code was taken from it.
    HyperNotificationFix, and its port here (com.hypergestures.notif), is an independent
    implementation by mexus.
  - Hiding the gesture line: the idea comes from HyperCeiler (AGPL-3.0). Idea only: no code was
    taken from it; HgHideGestureLine is an independent implementation (a fabricated runtime
    resource overlay).
  - MiuiHome / HyperOS behaviour (recents layouts, the back arrow, haptics timing, kill
    policies, and so on) is reproduced from observation on the phone and from constants and
    behaviour found by reverse engineering, for interoperability. No Xiaomi code, resources or
    assets were copied into this project.
